---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const services = [
  {
    title: '1 对 1 剧本深度诊断 / 急诊室',
    desc: '把你的前 5 集剧本或 80 集分集大纲发过来。用十年职业编剧眼光，逐集指出：哪里的矛盾软了、哪里的台词水了、哪个卡点能把留存拉高 20%。',
    status: '常年开放预约 · 需提前排期',
    badge: '高客单咨询',
  },
  {
    title: '短剧 / AI 漫剧全案故事架构定制',
    desc: '面向制片方、MCN 机构或出海平台，提供从核心麦格芬设计、世界观搭建、人物小传到黄金前三集的整套商业剧作全案开发。',
    status: '商业签约合作',
    badge: '全案开发',
  },
  {
    title: '短剧/漫剧变现实战训练营（内测筹备中）',
    desc: '拒绝录播水课，全流程实战带练。从 0 带你跑通一个完整能卖给平台的商用本子，优秀本子直接协助对接平台与制片方收剧渠道。',
    status: '敬请期待 · 可先加微信入预备群',
    badge: '训练营',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout activePath="/about" title="关于岛主与合作 · 岛主编剧工坊">
  <section class="pt-12 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Bio Header -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-cinema-900 border border-cinema-800 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 text-xs font-mono mb-4">
          🎬 ABOUT THE CREATOR
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight literary-serif mb-4">
          我是岛主，一个写了 10 年本子的职业影视编剧
        </h1>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-cinema-200 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            这十年里，我一直在影视剧作的案头深耕，经历过传统长片漫长磨人的立项周期，做过多部项目的剧本架构与故事医生。
          </p>
          <p>
            传统影视动辄三五年的开发周期让人疲惫，而微短剧与 AI 漫剧的爆发，让我看到了视听叙事最敏捷、最直接面对大众情绪的全新试验场。
          </p>
          <p class="text-amber-300 font-medium">
            但我看到市面上充斥着大量不懂视听语言、无脑抄袭套路的野路子剧本。我做这个站，就是要把影视工业正规军的剧作力学（结构、潜台词、多巴胺爽感循环），降维拆解成普通创作者也能直接照着抄、立刻能动手的工业化方法。
          </p>
          <p class="text-cinema-400 text-xs font-mono pt-2">
            不吹嘘浮夸数据，不搞虚假背书。手艺靠真案头说话，欢迎一切真诚的同行交流与项目合作。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commercial Services -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 mb-1">
          SERVICES & CONSULTING · 业务与变现
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white literary-serif">
          商业合作与咨询服务
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        {services.map((item) => (
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-cinema-900/90 border border-cinema-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/25">
                  {item.badge}
                </span>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">
                  {item.title}
                </h4>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-cinema-300 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                {item.desc}
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:text-right shrink-0">
              <span class="text-xs text-cinema-400 font-mono block mb-2">{item.status}</span>
              <a
                href="#contact"
                class="inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-cinema-800 hover:bg-amber-500 hover:text-cinema-950 text-white text-xs font-bold border border-cinema-700 transition-colors"
              >
                立即咨询
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact & Community Card -->
    <div id="contact" class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cinema-900 to-cinema-950 border border-cinema-700 shadow-xl">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 literary-serif">
          联系岛主 · 开启合作
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-cinema-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          无论你是寻求剧本诊断的写手、寻找爆款原创剧本的制片方，还是探索 AI 漫剧管线的工作室，随时联系我。
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-cinema-950 border border-cinema-800">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-cinema-400 font-medium">💬 个人微信:</span>
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold text-base select-all">bl-free</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-cinema-400 hidden sm:inline">(备注重度创作 / 项目合作)</span>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('bl-free').then(() => alert('已复制岛主微信【bl-free】到剪贴板！添加时请备注「重度创作」或「项目合作」。'))"
              class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-500/30 border border-amber-500/40 text-xs font-bold transition-all shrink-0 self-start sm:self-auto"
            >
              复制微信号
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-cinema-950 border border-cinema-800">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-cinema-400 font-medium">📕 小红书主页:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-medium">岛主编剧工坊</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-rose-400 bg-rose-950/50 border border-rose-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono font-semibold">
                984 次赞与收藏
              </span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://xhslink.cn/o/1t4rhxxzVDc"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-500/30 border border-rose-500/40 text-xs font-bold transition-all shrink-0 self-start sm:self-auto flex items-center gap-1.5"
            >
              <span>访问小红书主页</span>
              <span>➔</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-cinema-950 border border-cinema-800">
            <span class="text-cinema-400 w-28 shrink-0 font-medium">📮 官方邮箱:</span>
            <span class="text-cinema-200 font-mono select-all">contact@daozhu.script</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-cinema-400 sm:ml-auto">(商业项目/台本发件)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
